-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",220,{
[7009]="7003E2A6\n1\tSearch the flooded pits for some sign of the captive Lothrandir\tThe Grey Company has separated into groups in order to search more of Isengard for their captive kinsman.\n2\tTalk to Halbarad in the large chamber\tHalbarad has found a large room, its floor covered with dirty water, and has called for you to join him.\n3\tTalk to Lothrandir in the large chamber\tLothrandir stands before you, a shadow of his former self.\n4\tTalk to Golodir in the large chamber\tGolodir has found his way to the large chamber, and his anger is evident.\n5\tListen to Halbarad determine what must be done\tHalbarad has determined what should be done.\n6\tAllow the Rangers time to mourn\tThe Rangers have lost a kinsman and a friend, and are sharing a moment of grief before they must return to Aragorn with the sad news.\n7\tTalk to Gun Ain in the large chamber\tGun Ain has given voice to something remarkable. Can it be true? Does Lothrandir still live?\n8\tFind Lothrandir in a cell off the southernmost passage of the building\tThe woman named Mercy has told you where you might find Lothrandir: in the southernmost passage of the building in which you find yourself. You must search the building for him, and quickly!\n9\tTalk to Lothrandir in his cell\tLothrandir is in a cell unlocked by Gun Ain's key, off the southernmost passage.\n10\tTalk to Halbarad outside Lothrandir's cell\tHalbarad has reunited with his lost kinsman.\n",
[7010]="700208B0\n1\tTalk to Lothrandir\tLothrandir is in Kolo-hampât, seeking the 'screaming shadow' that has interfered with the Lossoth hunters.\n2\tTalk to Lothrandir\tLothrandir is in Kolo-hampât, waiting to speak with you.\n3\tFind the screaming shadow within the massive cavern\tLothrandir has gone his own way to search the depths of Kolo-hampât, and now you must seek out the mysterious 'screaming shadow' yourself.\n4\tTalk to the mysterious girl\tYou have found a mysterious girl crouched by a ragged camp-fire in the depths of Kolo-hampât.\n5\tLearn the history of this mysterious girl\tYou have found a mysterious girl crouched by a ragged camp-fire in the depths of Kolo-hampât.\n6\tDefend yourself from Gun Ain\tYou have found a mysterious girl crouched by a ragged camp-fire in the depths of Kolo-hampât and must now defend yourself from her. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tTalk to Lothrandir\tLothrandir has chosen to spare the life of Gun Ain and is waiting to speak to you.\n",
[7011]="70068BDE\n1\tPursue Khâshap\tKhâshap has fled deeper into the Streets of Râhal Bakh. Catch up to him before it is too late.\n2\tDefeat Utho the Grasper\tKhâshap has left his champion Utho to deal with you.\n3\tContinue the pursuit\tKhâshap continues his escape to another gate. But it seems he is out of options.\n4\tDefeat Khâshap\tThe pursuit of Khâshap has led you to a dead end. He has no choice but to take a stand.\n5\tTalk to Hadorion\tKhâshap at long last has been stopped. The engine of the apothecaries will no longer reach his masters, and the crisis averted. You should speak to Hadorion.\n",
[7012]="7003597E\n1\tTalk to Mossbeard\tMossbeard is standing outside of Drû Vádokan. Mossbeard is ready to tell you more of Núrzum's origins. You should speak with him and listen to his tale.\n2\tObserve Núrzum's meeting with his ally\tYou feel as if you can see Mossbeard's memories all around you. As Mossbeard speaks, he describes a meeting between Núrzum and Saruman inside Drû Vádokan. Núrzum's past and his purpose in Wildermore are becoming more clear with each passing moment.\n",
[7013]="70061BC7\n1\tTalk to Flam Helur\tFlam Helur has agreed to lead you and Meneldir to the Uruk he and his partner captured. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Drusi Begwyl\tDrusi Begwyl stands guard over her captive, and wants to ask you something.\n3\tTalk to the captive Uruk\tDrusi's captive sneers at you.\n4\tRemain alert and learn what brought Ushdul and the Uruks to Swanfleet\tMeneldir and the Stoors seek to learn what has brought Ushdul and the other Uruks to Swanfleet.\n5\tTalk to Meneldir\tMeneldir stands ready to fight whatever new danger approaches. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tReturn to the captive Uruk and remain on your guard\tYou have prevented the rescue of Ushdul by the Uruks.\n7\tTalk to the dying Ushdul\tUshdul is dying, pierced by arrows fired by his supposed rescuers.\n8\tHear Ushdul's dying words\tUshdul lies dying. He has demanded you listen to his final words.\n",
[7014]="7001466F\n1\tTalk to Bori\tBori is by one approach to Zabadgathol. Bori is waiting for you to accompany him to Zabadgathol.\n2\tKnock on the fortress door\tThe door to the fortress of Zabadgathol is ahead. Bori wants you to knock on the fortress door to summon Mazog.\n3\tTalk to Bori\tBori awaits an answer to his challenge. You should speak with Bori and defend him if the need arises.\n4\tSurvive your encounter with Gorothúl and do as he says\tBori has been frozen by some foul craft, and you are released to bring the grim tidings to the dwarves.\n5\tTalk to Sweina\tSweina has arrived on the outskirts. You should talk to Sweina about the grim turn of events.\n",
[7015]="7001B5D2\n1\tTalk to Sigileth\tSigileth is waiting to speak with you along Râd Iorist, in the Scuttledells.\n2\tDefend Mazog\tSigileth's position within Râd Iorist is under attack by the spiders of the Scuttledells. You must defend Sigileth and Mazog.\n3\tTalk to Sigileth\tYou have weathered a first attack by the spiders along Râd Iorist and should speak now to Sigileth.\n4\tSecure Mazog's shackles\tThe time has come to bring Mazog further along Râd Iorist, though the woods be haunted by spiders.\n5\tTalk to Achardor\tAchardor is holding vigil along Râd Iorist, the dangerous road to Dol Guldur that has been chosen by the Hidden Guard.\n6\tUse the Malledhrim banner to issue support commands to Achardor\tAchardor is waiting for you to provide a support command for him by using his Malledhrim banner.\n7\tDefend Mazog\tAchardor's position along Râd Iorist has come under attack by the spiders of the Scuttledells. You must defend Mazog from their attack!\n8\tTalk to Achardor\tYou have weathered another attack by the spiders of the Scuttledells and should speak now to Achardor.\n9\tDefend Mazog\tThe way Cúcheron scouted is not safe, and now the Elf must be defended from the spiders that chase him. Ensure that Mazog is not slain.\n10\tTalk to Cúcheron\tCúcheron has been saved, thanks to yours and Achardor's efforts, and Mazog remains a prisoner of the Hidden Guard.\n11\tTalk to Issuriel beyond the webs to the north-east\tIssuriel is somewhere along Râd Iorist, to the north-east of Achardor and Cúcheron. The spiders of the Scuttledells have woven webs behind her, and they must be cut away if the Elves are to join her with the prisoner.\n12\tDefend Issuriel\tIssuriel's position within Râd Iorist has come under attack by the spiders of the Scuttledells. She must be defended.\n13\tTalk to Achardor\tAchardor has arrived at Issuriel's position along Râd Iorist, with Mazog in tow.\n14\tTalk to Issuriel\tIssuriel has a bad feeling about something and wants to speak to you even as her nervousness grows.\n15\tHelp Achardor break free of the binding webs\tAchardor needs your help to break free of the webs and to follow Issuriel and Mazog deep into the forest of the Scuttledells.\n16\tCheck on the wounded Issuriel\tIssuriel has been grievously injured by the spiders of the Scuttledells and lies swooning beneath the light of the full moon. Mazog too has suffered an injury and seems to be in the same state.\n17\tDefend Achardor and the Hidden Guard\tThe Hidden Guard fights for its survival against the spiders of the Scuttledells, even while one of its number and its charge succumb to the poison of the spiders' master.\n18\tTalk to Sigileth\tThe path of the Hidden Guard along Râd Iorist has ended in disaster: Issuriel and Mazog have both been poisoned, and now the very success of the mission is endangered.\n",
[7016]="7002FEB6\n1\tObserve the meeting of Harding and his Captain\tHarding and Captain Agelmund are discussing the recent attacks by the Easterlings, and what else has set in motion around Harwick.\n2\tTalk to Aldor Harding\tHarding and Captain Agelmund are discussing the recent attacks by the Easterlings, and what else has set in motion around Harwick.\n3\tListen to Harding\tHarding and Captain Agelmund are meeting on the Officers balcony of the Meadhall.\n4\tSpeak with Agelmund, Captain of the Wold\tHarding and Captain Agelmund are meeting on the Officers' balcony of the Mead Hall.\n",
[7017]="7005B508\n1\tTalk to Shúkurz\tShúkurz waits for you a little ways into the tunnel.\n2\tFollow Shúkurz\tYou should follow Shúkurz deeper into the tunnel.\n3\tTalk to Shúkurz\tShúkurz might have seen what you saw. It wouldn't hurt to ask him.\n4\tFollow Shúkurz\tYou should continue following Shúkurz.\n5\tTalk to Shúkurz\tThe Orcs are eager for a fight. You should try to communicate with Shúkurz... somehow.\n6\tFight Shúkurz\tShúkurz is trying to feign a believable fight. You should play along, but stay close to Brukshar while fighting. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tFollow Shúkurz\tBrukshar has called off the fight. You should continue following Shúkurz.\n8\tTalk to Shúkurz\tYou and Shúkurz have managed to obtain Dhúrstrok's location, all while escaping with your lives. But you've been noticing strange things.... You should talk to Shúkurz.\n",
[7018]="7001B5CE\n1\tClear Thurimen, the cavern beneath the foundations of Dol Guldur, of foes\tYou have found a cavern beneath Dol Guldur and must clear it of foes if it is to be used by the Golden Host.\n2\tProceed further into Thurimen, clearing it of foes\tYou have cleared much of Thurimen of threats and should proceed onward and upwards.\n3\tProceed further into Thurimen, clearing it of foes\tYou have cleared much of Thurimen of threats and should proceed onward and upwards.\n4\tTalk to Bróin\tBróin and Sigileth have come to Thurimen and are amazed to see how well it suits their purposes.\n",
[7019]="7005F863\n1\tKing Thráin can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset. The Haban'akkâ of Thráin is attempting to wrest control of Máttugard from the Orcs of Mount Gundabad. You should talk to King Thráin and aid the Haban'akkâ!\t\n",
[7020]="70047BDD\n1\tListen to Elrohir's tale of the Battle of Dagorlad\tElrohir and Elladan are telling you the tale of the Last Alliance's victory at the Battle of Dagorlad. You should follow along and listen as Elrohir begins the tale.\n2\tFollow the Last Alliance into battle against the armies of Mordor\tThe Last Alliance gathered at a great bulwark in Dagorlad and prepared to strike against the armies of Mordor.\n3\tListen to Elladan's tale of the Battle of Dagorlad\tElrohir and Elladan are telling you the tale of the Last Alliance's victory at the Battle of Dagorlad. You should follow along and listen as Elladan continues the tale.\n4\tFollow the Last Alliance across the flaming trench toward Mordor\tElladan is describing the trials of the Last Alliance as they drew closer to the Black Gate.\n5\tListen to Elrohir's tale of the Last Alliance\tElrohir is describing the courage of Gil-galad and Elendil in the face of the Ringwraiths.\n6\tFollow Gil-galad and Elendil into battle against the Ringwraiths\tElrohir is describing a great battle between the Ringwraiths and the commanders of the Last Alliance.\n7\tListen as Elrohir concludes the tale of the Battle of Dagorlad\tElrohir is nearing the end of his tale. You should continue to follow along.\n8\tListen to Elrohir's final remarks\tElrohir has finished his tale of the Battle of Dagorlad.\n",
[7021]="700208A4\n1\tTalk to Pethelen\tPethelen is in the main hall of the House of Elrond. You have entered the House of Elrond with Pethelen, and he is waiting to speak with you.\n2\tEnter the Hall of Fire\tMaster Elrond is waiting for you in the Hall of Fire, inside the Last Homely House.\n3\tTalk to Lord Elrond\tMaster Elrond is in the Hall of Fire inside his house in Rivendell, waiting to speak with you.\n4\tWalk to the Library in the House of Elrond\tLord Elrond has asked to meet you in the library of his house to further discuss the charge: to gather the Dúnedain that they may ride to the aid of Aragorn in Rohan.\n5\tTalk to Lady Arwen\tArwen is outside the library in the House of Elrond and wishes to speak with you.\n6\tEnter the Library in the House of Elrond\tMaster Elrond is waiting inside the library of his house to speak with you.\n7\tTalk to Master Elrond\tLord Elrond is waiting to speak with you in the library of his house.\n8\tTalk to Master Elrond\tMaster Elrond is waiting to speak with you in the Library of his house.\n9\tTalk to Master Elrond\tMaster Elrond is waiting to speak with you in the Library of his house.\n10\tTalk to Elrohir\tElrohir is in the library of his father's house.\n11\tTalk to Master Elrond\tMaster Elrond is in the library of his house.\n",
[7022]="700159DC\n1\tDefeat veteran guardsmen (total: 8)\tYou must weaken the camp's response to your attack by ambushing and eliminating a number of their veteran guardsman before the main phase of the assault begins.\n2\tBurned tents ([see journal]/40)\tGrab torches from the bonfire in the centre of the Dunlanding camp and set fire to as many tents as possible in order to create panic and disorder.\n3\tDefeat the Dunlending captain\tYou must find and defeat the Dunlending captain before he can rally his troops to fight off your assault.\n4\tUse the ancient anvil\030Collect Infused Adamant\tUse the ancient forge to empower your infused adamant.\n5\tSpeak to Perimbant\tSpeak with Perimbant to return to Echad Dúnann.\n",
[7023]="7001B5F5\n1\tTalk to Issuriel\tIssuriel is waiting to speak with you upon the path of Râd Cened. You have come part of the way along Raddir's chosen route through the Drownholt and must now walk the path of Râd Cened with Mazog.\n2\tUse the banner of the Golden Host to issue support commands to Issuriel\tIssuriel has asked you to use her banner of the Golden Host to issue commands that she may support you in battle with whatever approaches.\n3\tDefend Mazog\tRâd Cened Creepers have gathered to attack intruders within the Drownholt! You must defend Mazog from this threat!\n4\tTalk to Issuriel\tIssuriel is waiting to speak with you along the path of Râd Cened.\n5\tSecure Mazog's shackles\tIssuriel asked you to secure Mazog's shackles and to escort him forwards through the fens of the Drownholt to Cúcheron, waiting further ahead.\n6\tTalk to Cúcheron\tCúcheron has scouted the next leg of your journey through the Drownholt with Mazog.\n7\tUse the banner of the Golden Host to issue support commands to Cúcheron\tCúcheron has asked you to use his banner of the Golden Host to issue commands that he may support you in battle.\n8\tDefend Mazog\tCúcheron's position along the Hidden Guard's road through the Drownholt has come under attack. You must defend Mazog from these foes.\n9\tTalk to Cúcheron\tCúcheron is waiting to ask you something, now that the attacks have ceased for the moment.\n10\tClear the tunnel of danger so Mazog can be safely escorted through it\tCúcheron has asked you to clear the tunnel north-east of his position of danger while he guards Mazog and to then return to him.\n11\tReturn to Cúcheron\tCúcheron is outside the tunnel, guarding Mazog and waiting for your return.\n12\tSecure Mazog's shackles\tIt is time to bring Mazog further along Râd Cened, the route Raddir has selected to bring the Hidden Guard through the perilous Drownholt.\n13\tTalk to Sigileth\tSigileth has scouted the next leg of your journey through the Drownholt with Mazog.\n14\tUse the banner of the Golden Host to issue support commands to Sigileth\tSigileth has asked you to use her banner of the Golden Host to issue commands that she may support you in battle.\n15\tDefend Mazog\tSigileth's position along the Hidden Guard's road through the Drownholt has come under attack. You must defend Mazog from these foes.\n16\tTalk to Sigileth\tSigileth is waiting to speak with you, now that the attacks have ceased for the moment.\n17\tSecure Mazog's shackles\tSigileth asked you to secure Mazog's shackles and to escort him forward through the fens of the Drownholt to Raddir, waiting further ahead.\n18\tExamine the body\tThe unthinkable has happened: Raddir has been slain within the Drownholt.\n19\tSecure Mazog's shackles\tMazog has a sinister look in his eye. Ensure that his shackles remain secure.\n20\tReach Achardor before Mazog does\tMazog is trying to escape! You must reach Achardor, further along the path chosen by Raddir through the Drownholt, before Mazog does! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n21\tTalk to Achardor\tYou have warned Achardor of Mazog's attempt to escape, and now the Orc can be recaptured.\n22\tTalk to Achardor in the cellar of the Haunted Inn\tFollowing the death of Raddir, the Hidden Guard has made its limping way to the cellar of an inn among the Dourstocks, there to decide what can be done.\n23\tTalk to Bróin\tBróin is in the Bleak Cellar, waiting to speak with you.\n",
[7024]="70030B4F\n1\tTalk to Oldheart\tOldheart stands in a clearing in the distant reaches of the Black Heart. You should speak with Oldheart.\n",
[7025]="70028284\n1\tDefeat Dievlig sentries (total: 3)\tDefeat several of the sentries guarding the prisoners.\n2\tTalk to Ilar\030Talk to Mair\030Talk to Naeglanc\tRescue Ilar, Mair, and Naeglanc from the Dievlig.\n3\tDefeat Gerwun\tFind and defeat Gerwun.\n",
[7026]="70041245\n1\tFind the location marked on the Orkish map\tYou have nearly arrived at the location marked on the Orkish map.\n2\tContinue south-east past the Orc patrols to the location marked on the map\tYou are making your way through the Dead Marshes to the location marked on the Orkish map.\n3\tContinue your search for Artamir. Did he come to this place?\tYou have not yet found Artamir, but you do not wish to give up the search. Perhaps he is just ahead.\n4\tBreak Artamir from his reverie\tYou have found Artamir, but he stares into the water as if entranced, and does not notice you.\n",
[7027]="700443DE\n1\tTalk to Bingo before the storm gets worse\tYou have been caught out in the storm with Bingo, Egwylf, and Willem.\n2\tLook for a place to shelter from the storm\tThe rain and the wind has become very intense, and Bingo wants to find a sheltered place to stay.\n3\tProtect Bingo from the Nazgûl\tA Nazgûl has descended upon the plains of Rohan, and Bingo is in danger!\n4\tPick up the torch from the ground where it has fallen\tEgwylf thinks you might be able to drive away the Nazgûl if you can set the grass afire.\n5\tProtect Egwylf and Willem from the Nazgûl\tThe Nazgûl hisses angrily. It does not wish to get close to the flames!\n6\tTalk to Egwylf\tThe Nazgûl has fled.\n",
[7028]="7002C69B\n1\tTalk to Nona in the Rushgore\tYou are walking through the Rushgore with Nona when she stops and wants to talk to you about something.\n2\tWalk with Nona through the Rushgore\tYou are making your way through the Rushgore with Nona.\n3\tTalk to Nona atop the rocky rise in the Rushgore\tNona is standing on a small rise amidst rocks in the Rushgore. Some terrible presence has come near to you in the Rushgore.\n4\tSurvive your encounter with great evil in the Rushgore\tAn evil presence has come to the Rushgore, and you are in great danger!\n5\tSurvive the Easterling ambush and prevent any of them from alerting their fellows\tThere are Easterlings in the mists of the Rushgore, and something worse beside!\n6\tTalk to the Khundolar Captain\tAn Easterling has attempted to escape, and you need to defeat him before he alerts his fellows.\n7\tThe Nazgûl stands atop the hill. You need to find a means of driving it off!\tNona is somewhere in the Rushgore, and it sounds like she's in trouble!\n8\tFind Nona! She is in grave danger!\tNona is somewhere in the Rushgore, and it sounds like she's in trouble!\n9\tBring Nona to Stangard for the healing she needs\tYou have brought Nona to Stangard, but do not know if the Rohirrim will be able to save her life.\n10\tTalk to Nona where she lies in Stangard\tYou have brought Nona to Stangard, but do not know if the Rohirrim will be able to save her life.\n11\tTalk to Horn in Stangard\tHorn is waiting to speak to you about the price for healing Nona.\n12\tTalk to Nona where she lies in Stangard\tNona is struggling to speak.\n13\tTalk to Horn in Stangard\tHorn is waiting for your answer in Stangard.\n14\tTravel to Lothlórien to seek the aid of Galadriel\tYou have come to seek the aid of Galadriel. Will she give it?\n15\tTalk to Horn in Lothlórien\tHorn is standing uncomfortably in Lothlórien, waiting to speak with you.\n16\tTalk to Galadriel in Lothlórien\tGaladriel has come to speak with you about Nona.\n",
[7029]="7000B04E\n1\tSpeak to Golodir\tAid Golodir as you make your way deeper into the Castle of the Witch-king.\n2\tTalk to Golodir\tWith the light of Dúnachar, Golodir has defeated Mordirith, although the villain escaped before he could be completely defeated. You should speak with Golodir to see what he would wish you to do.\n3\tTalk to Golodir\tYou should speak with Golodir at once.\n",
[7030]="70047A37\n1\tTalk to Aragorn atop the eastern slag hill\tAragorn is atop the eastern slag hill, ready to engage once more with the enemies that approach.\n2\tStand your ground and defend Aragorn\tThe eastern slag hill has come under heavy attack, and Aragorn calls his kinsmen to him for the final defence.\n3\tFind Calenglad where he fell on the battlefield\tAragorn has asked you to find Calenglad where he fell, if you can, and ease his pain.\n4\tAragorn has asked you to make your way to the western slag hill and to help soldiers caught in the middle of the fighting.\t\n5\tTalk to Golasgil between the slag hills\tGolasgil of Anfalas has been caught between the slag hills and needs your help.\n6\tDefeat the Olog that crushed Golasgil\tGolasgil has been thrown to the ground by a great Olog, and now the beast seeks to finish what it began.\n7\tTalk to Golasgil where he lies\tGolasgil has been mortally wounded.\n8\tFind Pippin atop the western slag hill\tYou have heard Pippin's voice from above the din of battle. He needs your help!\n9\tTalk to Beregond atop the western slag hill\tBeregond is atop the western slag hill, calling for help.\n10\tCheck on Pippin where he lies\tPippin lies beneath a great Olog atop the western slag hill.\n11\tTalk to Beregond atop the western slag hill\tThe battle rages all around you, and Beregond intends to rally the forces to keep fighting until the end.\n",
[7031]="7000B8AA\n1\tTalk to Calenglad\tCalenglad is inside the keep on Tinnudir. You have entered the keep on Tinnudir to confront Mordrambor, the imprisoned Black Númenórean.\n2\tConfront Mordrambor with Calenglad\tCalenglad is inside the keep on Tinnudir. You and Calenglad have entered the keep on Tinnudir to confront Mordrambor, the imprisoned Black Númenórean.\n3\tFind Tadan\tTadan is inside the room atop the stairs, where Mordrambor was being held prisoner. The Black Númenórean has escaped from his prison, and there is no sign of his jailor.\n4\tTalk to Calenglad\tCalenglad is inside the keep on Tinnudir. Mordrambor has escaped, and in his wake, he has left the dead and the dying.\n",
[7032]="70061B9A\n1\tTalk to Bevan at the gate of Mossward (Move forward by pressing W, and right-click on Bevan to talk to him)\tThe guard at the gate of Mossward greets you with a friendly smile, beckoning for you to approach. (Move forward by pressing W, and right-click on Bevan to talk to him)\n2\tTalk to Geralt by the fountain in the town square (You can move forward by pressing W, and steer to the left and right with your A and D keys)\tBevan at the gate recommended that you introduce yourself to Geralt, one of the residents of Mossward. (Move forward by pressing W, turn to the left and right with A and D, and move backward by pressing S.)\n3\tEnter the Mossward blacksmith shop to the south-east of the fountain. (Right-click on the door to open it, and then move into the door by pressing W)\tSkardí Bendblade is inside the Mossward blacksmith shop to the south-east of the fountain. (Enter the Blacksmith Shop by right-clicking on the door to open it, and then press W to walk inside)\n4\tTalk to Skardí Bendblade inside the Mossward blacksmith shop\tSkardí Bendblade is inside the Mossward blacksmith shop south of the gate.\n5\tWait for Skardí Bendblade to go behind the counter (Holding down the right mouse button allows you to spin your camera and keep people of interest in view)\tSkardí Bendblade is very interested to see an adventurer like you in the peaceful village of Mossward. (Holding down the right mouse button allows you to spin your camera and keep people of interest in view)\n6\tSet your gear down on the counter (Right-click on the sparkling location to set your gear down on the counter)\tSkardí Bendblade has asked you to set your gear down on the counter, and he will fix it up for free... this time. (Right-clicking on the sparkling location will set your gear down on the counter)\n7\tWait for Skardí Bendblade to repair your equipment and set it on the counter\tWait for Skardí Bendblade to set your equipment on the counter, and then take it.\n8\tWait for Skardí Bendblade to repair your equipment and set it on the counter\tWait for Skardí Bendblade to set your equipment on the counter, and then take it.\n9\tTake your gear from the counter and talk to Skardí Bendblade (Right-click on the satchel to open it and see its contents. Right-clicking on items inside a satchel will pick them up and put them into your inventory. You can press 'I' to see your Inventory.)\tSkardí Bendblade has repaired your gear and invited you to pick it up from the counter. He eagerly waits for your feedback on the work he has done. (Right-click on the sparkling satchel to open it and see its contents. Right-clicking on items inside a satchel will pick them up and put them into your inventory. You can press 'I' to see the contents of your Inventory)\n10\tEquip your weapons and talk to Meneldir inside the blacksmith shop (When you acquire new weapons and armour, you can press 'I' to see them in your Inventory. From there, you can equip them by right-clicking their icons, or by dragging them onto your Character Panel, which you can access by pressing 'C')\tThe man standing inside the Mossward blacksmith shop, Meneldir, has called you to speak to him. (When you acquire new weapons and armour, you can press 'I' to see them in your Inventory. From there, you can equip them by right-clicking their icons, or by dragging them onto your Character Panel, which you can access by pressing 'C')\n11\tListen to Meneldir and Skardí discuss events\tThe ringing of the town bells signals that danger has come to Mossward!\n12\tFollow Meneldir outside to learn what trouble has come to Mossward\tMeneldir has hurried outside the blacksmith shop, and you should follow him. The ringing of the bells signals that some trouble has come to Mossward.\n13\tTalk to Meneldir in the Mossward town square\tMossward is under attack, and Meneldir needs your help to save the town.\n14\tDefeat the Goblin Raider (Right-click on the Goblin Raider to enter combat with the enemy)\tYou have found one of the villains responsible for attacking the town of Mossward. What has brought goblins like this one to Swanfleet?\n15\tStand alongside Meneldir and remain alert\tYou have defeated the goblin, but he could not have set all these fires by himself. He surely has allies nearby.\n16\tTalk to Eleri\tEleri has called for everyone in Mossward to help protect the town from the ravages of the goblin raiding party.\n17\tPrepare yourself to defend the villagers from Madthrug, leader of the raiding party\tYou have found the apparent leader of the raiding party, and he is no goblin... he is one of the fighting Uruk-hai! Madthrug leads the raiding party against Mossward, threatening the peaceful townspeople.\n18\tDefeat Madthrug\tYou must defeat Madthrug to ensure the safety of Mossward!\n19\tMake sure Tegwyn is safe\tYou have helped to save Mossward from the ravages of the Uruks... but why did they come to the town in the first place?\n20\tTalk to Wenna\tTegwyn's mother Wenna is grateful for your help saving her son from the Uruks.\n21\tTalk to Meneldir\tMeneldir stands by the gate of Mossward, considering the events of the last few minutes.\n22\tMeneldir has a request for you.\t\n",
[7033]="700466F6\n1\tTalk to Éomer\tSpeak with Éomer on the Pelennor.\n2\tPick up the torch\tPick up the torch for lighting the pyre.\n3\tLight the pyre\tUse the torch to light the pyre.\n4\tListen to the record of the fallen\tListen to Éomer as he speaks the names of the fallen.\n5\tMourn the loss of your fellow warriors\tYou are overcome by the loss of many great warriors.\n6\tTalk to Éomer\tSpeak with Éomer on the Pelennor.\n7\tPick up the stone for Snowmane's cairn\tPick up the stone for Snowmane's cairn.\n8\tPlace the stone on the cairn for Snowmane\tPlace the stone on the cairn that marks Snowmane's grave.\n9\tRemain alert while Éomer speaks\tListen to Éomer speak.\n10\tTalk to Éomer\tSpeak with Éomer on the Pelennor.\n11\tEnter the Tower of Ecthelion with Éomer\tEnter the Tower of Ecthelion.\n12\tTalk to Éomer\tSpeak with Éomer inside the Tower of Ecthelion.\n13\tWalk with Éomer to Théoden's bedside\tWalk with Éomer to pay respects to Théoden.\n14\tMourn for Théoden King\tPay your respects to Théoden King.\n15\tTalk to Éomer\tSpeak with Éomer at the Tower of Ecthelion.\n",
[7034]="70048BFC\n1\tTalk to Yadêphal in Barad-dûr\tYadêphal is in Barad-dûr, where Sauron reigned.\n2\tFollow Yadêphal to Dulgabêth in Barad-dûr\tAragorn has given you authority to treat with Dulgabêth on his behalf.\n3\tTell Dulgabêth your name and your title\tDulgabêth is in Barad-dûr, and demands to know why you have come to treat with him instead of Aragorn.\n4\tListen to Dulgabêth's offer in Barad-dûr\tAragorn has given you authority to hear what Dulgabêth has to say.\n5\tTell Dulgabêth you will bring his offer before the king\tAragorn will never accept this offer, but you should tell Dulgabêth of your intention to bring it before the king.\n",
[7035]="70027176\n1\tDeliver Munfaeril's warning to Madin Brenin\tDeliver Munfaeril's warning to Madin Brenin in Barnavon.\n2\tDefeat Madin Brenin and his guards\tDefeat Madin Brenin and his guards.\n",
[7036]="70058574\n1\tApproach Lúkhag\tLúkhag is waiting for you on the road leading to Dûn Traikh.\n2\tDefend Lúkhag\tLúkhag appears to know where she's going, but will need you to defend her.\n3\tTalk to Aighrig\tLúkhag has led you to Aighrig, who has come to Dûn Traikh alone.\n4\tDefend Aighrig\tAighrig is determined to find Latharn.\n5\tTalk to Aighrig\tAighrig has stopped in front of the tower and has something to say.\n6\tObserve the confrontation\tAighrig seems intent on confronting the Angmarim at the tower's entrance. She has asked you not to attack them unless it's in self-defence.\n7\tDefend Aighrig\tThe conversation between Latharn and Aighrig has not ended peacefully.\n8\tTalk to Aighrig\tLatharn has been defeated. You should check on Aighrig.\n",
[7037]="70071541\n1\tTalk to Tatháta on the dock\tTatháta is beside the Heirsworn ship Phazanêg.\n2\tConfront Aphadaer and Balakhâd\tAphadaer has sought the protection of Balakhâd for the death of King Elessar.\n3\tTell them no, the King will live\tAphadaer claims he has taken the life of King Elessar. Tell him no, for the King will survive his wound.\n4\tRemain alert for any Heirsworn treachery\tRemain alert for any treachery on the part of the Heirsworn.\n5\tPrepare for battle and speak to Aphadaer\tAphadaer has decided to prove his loyalty to Balakhâd and the Heirs of Castamir by facing you in battle.\n6\tRemain on your guard as you confront the leadership of the Song\tRemain on your guard against those who command the Song of Waves and Wind.\n7\tPrepare for battle and talk to Nakási Wave-reaper\tNakási Wave-reaper has accomplished her mission, and she stares at you with contentment.\n8\tDefeat Nakási Wave-reaper\tThe battle is over.\n",
[7038]="7004A8DF\n1\tSignal Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg can be found at Torech Ungol. You and Captain Róglarg have led a company of Orcs to Torech Ungol to be sacrificed to Shelob.\n2\t\"Escort\" the sacrifices to Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg\tYou have come to Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg and should now lead the sacrifices to the mouth of Torech Ungol.\n3\tSignal Captain Róglarg at Torech Ungol\tCaptain Róglarg is standing before the sealed entrance to Torech Ungol. You have brought the sacrifices to the mouth of Torech Ungol, but it is blocked by stone and debris. You should get Captain Róglarg's attention and see if he knows what to do.\n4\tClear debris from the sealed entrance to Torech Ungol (total: 3)\tDebris can be found outside the mouth of Torech Ungol. Captain Róglarg has ordered you to clear debris from the main tunnel of Torech Ungol in an attempt to appease Shelob.\n5\tReturn to Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg is standing before the sealed entrance to Torech Ungol. You have cleared the debris as Captain Róglarg ordered. Aside from the tremors of shifting rocks in the depths of Torech Ungol, seemingly no progress has been made in unsealing Torch Ungol.\n6\tKeep watch on the Orcs and await Her Ladyship's arrival\tYou should await Her Ladyship's arrival at Torech Ungol until Captain Róglarg signals otherwise.\n7\tReturn to Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg is keeping watch at Torech Ungol. Captain Róglarg has called you over. You should see what he wants.\n8\tSignal 'no' to Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg is keeping watch at Torech Ungol. Captain Róglarg has asked you if you know where the two missing Orcs in the company have gone. You should tell him no, even if you know better.\n9\tFlee Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg!\tWebs have shot forth from the hidden caves and tunnels of Torech Ungol, dragging many Orcs in your company to their dooms. You should flee Torech Ungol with Captain Róglarg.\n10\tEscape with Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg has fled to the entrance of Torech Ungol. You have escaped the webs of Shelob and her children with Captain Róglarg. You should escape and return to Cirith Ungol.\n11\tTry to free yourself from the webs!\tYou are trapped in the thick webs of Her Ladyship! You must struggle free!\n12\tTalk to Legolas at Torech Ungol\tLegolas can be found near the entrance of Torech Ungol. Legolas has freed you from the webs that ensnared you. You should speak to Legolas and flee Torech Ungol!\n",
[7039]="700408AB\n1\tNegotiate with Jajax\tJajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel. You should speak with Jajax.\n2\tSpeak with Jajax to tell him you agree\tJajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel. You should speak with Jajax.\n3\tWatch the confrontation between Jajax and Hebil\tHebil has come to ask for Jajax's help.\n",
[7040]="7002C606\n1\tTalk to Noriel\tYou should speak with Noriel at once.\n2\tDefeat attackers\tOrcs are attacking Thinglad! You should defeat many Orcs.\n3\tThank Wynmar for his intervention\tYou should talk to Wynmar.\n4\tListen to Noriel and Wynmar\tObserve the dialogue between Noriel and Wynmar.\n5\tTalk to Noriel\tYou should talk to Noriel.\n",
})
